WEBVTT

00:08:57.825 --> 00:09:01.870
and be the largest network
of women drivers connected to each other.

00:09:02.413 --> 00:09:04.331
By rethinking mobility for women,

00:09:05.082 --> 00:09:09.044
giving them a safe transport
and safety outside of home,

00:09:09.086 --> 00:09:11.922
it is our hope to transform our culture.

00:09:12.715 --> 00:09:16.885
Apart from having a profound impact
on the Indian economy,

00:09:16.927 --> 00:09:19.722
this is about something much bigger.

00:09:19.763 --> 00:09:24.977
As you all know,
when we move, we can be seen.

00:09:26.437 --> 00:09:30.024
The more women
see other women in public spaces,